_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 5
---
order: 5
---
short_label: V.5
---
statement: If a magnitude is the same multiple of a magnitude that a subtracted part is of a subtracted part, then the remainder also is the same multiple of the remainder that the whole is of the whole.
---
proof:

Let the magnitude *AB* be the same multiple of the magnitude *CD* that the subtracted part *AE* is of the subtracted part *CF.*

I say that the remainder *EB* is also the same multiple of the remainder *FD* that the whole *AB* is of the whole *CD.*

Make *CG* so that *EB* is the same multiple of *CG* that *AE* is of *CF.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="300" height="100" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="V.5 diagram" src="propV5.gif"/></noscript>
